#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/puppet.rst:30
msgid "Allow Immediate Execution"
msgstr "Allow Immediate Execution"

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/puppet.rst:32
msgid ""
"When adding or editing a Puppet integration, users have the option to "
"\"Allow Immediate Execution\". Using this feature will connect to the Puppet"
" Master after the Puppet Agent is installed and force configuration "
"application immediately. This is an optional convenience feature, if it's "
"not used, the Puppet Master will still apply configuration to the node on "
"its own schedule. Using this feature requires supplying SSH credentials. If "
"you do not wish to provide SSH credentials to |morpheus| select \"No\" to "
"opt out of this feature and they do not need to be provided."
msgstr ""
"When adding o editing un Puppet integration, users tienen el opción to "
"\"Allow Immediate Execution\". Using este característica será connect to el "
"Puppet Master después de el Puppet Agent es instalado y force configuración "
"application immediately. This es un opcional convenience característica, if "
"it's no used, el Puppet Master será aún apply configuración to el node on "
"its own schedule. Using este característica requires supplying SSH "
"credentials. If you no wish to provide SSH credentials to |morpheus| select "
"\"No\" to opt out of este característica y they no need to be provided."

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/puppet.rst:35
msgid "Associating a Puppet Integration with a Cloud"
msgstr "Associating un Puppet Integration con un Cloud"

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/puppet.rst:37
msgid ""
"By associating a Puppet Integration with a Cloud, users are able to "
"automatically install the Puppet Agent, select a Puppet environment, and "
"supply a Puppet Node Name at provision time. The integration association is "
"made when adding or editing a Cloud integration in |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"By associating un Puppet Integration con un Cloud, users son able to "
"automáticamente install el Puppet Agent, select un Puppet entorno, y supply "
"un Puppet Node Name at provision time. La integración association es made "
"cuando adding o editing un Cloud integration in |morpheus|."

