msgstr "Save cambios to el Cloud integration"

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/puppet.rst:46
msgid "Creating Puppet Agent Install Tasks"
msgstr "Crear Puppet Agent Install Tasks"

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/puppet.rst:48
msgid ""
"Puppet Agent Install Tasks automate the process of installing the Puppet "
"Agent, selecting the Puppet environment, and supplying the Puppet Node Name."
" We can run this Task on-demand as needed for individual Instances or "
"servers or add them to workflows to build a Puppet Agent installation step "
"into larger automation suites."
msgstr ""
"Puppet Agent Install Tasks automate el proceso of installing el Puppet "
"Agent, selecting el Puppet entorno, y supplying el Puppet Node Name. We "
"puede run este Task on-demand según sea necesario para individual Instances "
"o servers o add them to workflows to build un Puppet Agent instalación paso "
"en larger automation suites."

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/puppet.rst:50
